..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : KILL.ME
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : fwester
.. Kontrolle      : lei
.. Funktion       : Initialisiert den Maskenpuffer.
.. Ablauf         : Maskeneintritts-EFOP
..
.. Functionality  : Initializes buffer of mask.
.. Program flow   : Mask entry efop
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Declarations
.type DVM2 xmydata
.type text xcommand
.type bool xbackground
.type integer xdesc
.type text x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7 x8 x9 x10 x11
..
.. Initializations
.file -tempname U|xmydata
.formula U|xdesc = 1
.copy U|xbackground = G|TRUE
.formula U|xcommand = "datanm SHOW " + U|xmydata
.copy M|testmode = G|batchmode
..
.. Create table with callers
.input "is/FO.SYSTEM"
.continue ERROR01 ? _F|filenotempty(U|xmydata)
.occupy 'U|xmydata'
.file -open U|xdesc 'U|xmydata'
..
!READ: Read own log file entry
.. ASCII-Tabs als Feldtrenner, letzter Backspace
.file -read U|xdesc U|x1 	 U|x2 	 U|x3 	 U|x4 	 U|x5 	 U|x6 	 U|x7 	 U|x8 	 U|x9 	 U|x10 U|x11
.continue END ? _G|mehr
.continue READ ? U|x5 <> G|aufrufernr
.occupy
.file -close U|xdesc
.formula M|ownprocessid = U|x1
.formula M|owndisplay = (U|x3 >> ":") <$ ":"
.formula M|ownhost = U|x4
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..*****************************************************************************
..
!ERROR01: Missing own data!
.error -message Die eigenen Prozessdaten sind nicht ermittelbar!
.end 10
